a versare una lacrima. Il giorno dopo inizia una relazione occasionale con Marie, una collega, e torna rapidamente alla solita routine. Ben presto, però, la sua vita quotidiana è sconvolta dal vicino, Raymond Sintès, che lo trascina nei suoi loschi affari, finché su una spiaggia, in una giornata torrida, si abbatte la tragedia."},{"language":"en-US","title":"The Stranger","overview":"Algiers, 1938. Meursault, a quiet and unassuming employee in his early thirties, attends his mother's funeral without shedding a tear. The next day, he begins a casual affair with Marie, a work colleague. He quickly slips back into his usual routine."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Alger, 1938. Meursault, un jeune homme d’une trentaine d’années, modeste employé, enterre sa mère sans manifester la moindre émotion. Le lendemain, il entame une liaison avec Marie, une collègue de bureau. Puis il reprend sa vie de tous les jours. Mais son voisin, Raymond Sintès vient perturber son quotidien en l’entraînant dans des histoires louches jusqu’à un drame sur une plage, sous un soleil de plomb…"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mn7NG3TVqAPKAG4l1LcGyhl4Xk.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aTjFGxR7K32HPxrdvJOVeXX1UCe.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":1429348,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mn7NG3TVqAPKAG4l1LcGyhl4Xk.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mn7NG3TVqAPKAG4l1LcGyhl4Xk.jpg","language":"it","width":1667,"height":2500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mn7NG3TVqAPKAG4l1LcGyhl4Xk.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mn7NG3TVqAPKAG4l1LcGyhl4Xk.jpg","language":"it","width":1667,"height":2500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bj